Subject: [PATCH 4/9] ARM: dts: am335x-pepper: Fix the audio CODEC's reset pin
Date: Wed, 8 Nov 2017 15:25:00 -0600
Message-ID: <20171108212505.28320-5-afd@ti.com>
References: <20171108212505.28320-1-afd@ti.com>
Mime-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain
